---@alias aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentJobSummaries aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentJobSummary[]

---Summary information for an enrichment job returned by ListEnrichmentJobs. This lightweight representation includes identifiers, status, and key metadata without the full job configuration.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentJobSummary
---@field jobId aws.iotsitewise.ID Unique identifier for the enrichment job.
---@field status aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentJobStatus Current status of the job: PENDING, RUNNING, COMPLETED, FAILED, TIMED_OUT, or CANCELLED. Use this to quickly identify active jobs or jobs requiring attention.
---@field workspaceName aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceName The name of the IoT SiteWise workspace containing this job.
---@field jobType aws.iotsitewise.JobType The type of enrichment job. Currently EVENT_DETECTION is the only supported type.
---@field datasetId aws.iotsitewise.ID The dataset being enriched. Useful for filtering and identifying jobs without fetching the full configuration. This allows you to quickly find all jobs related to a specific dataset.
---@field propertyAlias? aws.iotsitewise.AssetPropertyAlias The property alias (human-readable sensor name) of the time series being enriched. Present when the job was created using a propertyAlias. Use this to identify which sensor the job analyzes.
---@field timeSeriesId? aws.iotsitewise.TimeSeriesId The system identifier of the time series being enriched. Present when the job was created using a timeSeriesId. Use this to identify which time series the job analyzes.
---@field createdAt string Timestamp when the job was created in ISO 8601 format.
---@field updatedAt? string Timestamp of the last job status change in ISO 8601 format. Use this to track recent activity and identify stale jobs. For active jobs, this shows the last time the job transitioned to a new status.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentStatus "ENRICHED"|"NOT_ENRICHED"

---Time range settings for extracting a specific window of video time-series data to process.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.EnrichmentTrimSettings
---@field startTime aws.iotsitewise.TimeInNanos Start time for the video analysis time range in nanoseconds since Unix epoch (TimeInNanos format). Data segments at or after this time are included in the enrichment. Must be within the dataset's time bounds.
---@field endTime aws.iotsitewise.TimeInNanos End time for the video analysis time range in nanoseconds since Unix epoch (TimeInNanos format). Data segments at or before this time are included in the enrichment. Must be greater than startTime and within the dataset's time bounds.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.EntryId string

