---@field nextToken? aws.iotsitewise.NextToken Pagination token to retrieve the next page of results. If present, more jobs exist that match the filter criteria. Include this token in a subsequent ListEnrichmentJobs request to retrieve the next page. If absent, you have retrieved all matching jobs.

