---@field propertyId? aws.iotsitewise.Macro The ID of the property to use as the variable. You can use the property name if it's from the same asset model. If the property has an external ID, you can specify externalId: followed by the external ID. For more information, see Using external IDs in the IoT SiteWise User Guide.
---@field hierarchyId? aws.iotsitewise.Macro The ID of the hierarchy to query for the property ID. You can use the hierarchy's name instead of the hierarchy's ID. If the hierarchy has an external ID, you can specify externalId: followed by the external ID. For more information, see Using external IDs in the IoT SiteWise User Guide.
---@field propertyPath? aws.iotsitewise.AssetModelPropertyPath The path of the property.

---Contains an asset property value (of a single type only).
---@class aws.iotsitewise.Variant
---@field stringValue? aws.iotsitewise.PropertyValueStringValue Asset property data of type string (sequence of characters). The allowed pattern: "^$|[^\u0000-\u001F\u007F]+". The max length is 1024.
---@field integerValue? aws.iotsitewise.PropertyValueIntegerValue Asset property data of type integer (whole number).
---@field doubleValue? aws.iotsitewise.PropertyValueDoubleValue Asset property data of type double (floating point number). The min value is -10^10. The max value is 10^10. Double.NaN is allowed.
---@field booleanValue? aws.iotsitewise.PropertyValueBooleanValue Asset property data of type Boolean (true or false).
---@field nullValue? aws.iotsitewise.PropertyValueNullValue The type of null asset property data with BAD and UNCERTAIN qualities.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.Version string

---The allowed video data types.
---@alias aws.iotsitewise.VideoDataType "VIDEO-MP4"

---Set this period to specify how long your data is stored in the warm tier before it is deleted. You can set this only if cold tier is enabled.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WarmTierRetentionPeriod
---@field numberOfDays? aws.iotsitewise.NumberOfDays The number of days the data is stored in the warm tier.
---@field unlimited? aws.iotsitewise.Unlimited If set to true, the data is stored indefinitely in the warm tier.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.WarmTierState "ENABLED"|"DISABLED"

---Contains the encryption configuration for a workspace.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceEncryptionConfiguration
---@field encryptionType aws.iotsitewise.EncryptionType|string The encryption scheme for the workspace. SITEWISE_DEFAULT_ENCRYPTION encrypts data with the IoT SiteWise default key. KMS_BASED_ENCRYPTION encrypts data with the customer managed KMS key identified by kmsKeyId.
---@field kmsKeyId? aws.iotsitewise.KmsKeyId The customer managed KMS key used when encryptionType is KMS_BASED_ENCRYPTION. Accepts a key ID, key ARN, or key alias. Required for KMS_BASED_ENCRYPTION; must be omitted for SITEWISE_DEFAULT_ENCRYPTION. After a workspace's customer managed key configuration becomes active, the key can't be changed.

---Contains the encryption configuration information for a workspace.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceEncryptionConfigurationInfo
---@field encryptionType aws.iotsitewise.EncryptionType The type of encryption used for the workspace.
---@field kmsKeyArn? aws.iotsitewise.ARN The key ARN of the KMS key used for KMS encryption if encryptionType is KMS_BASED_ENCRYPTION.

---Contains the details of an error associated with a workspace.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceErrorDetails
---@field code aws.iotsitewise.ErrorCode The error code.
---@field message aws.iotsitewise.Description The error message.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceName string

---The current state of a workspace. The state changes as the workspace is created, updated, or deleted.
---@alias aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceState "CREATING"|"ACTIVE"|"UPDATING"|"DELETING"|"FAILED"

---Contains information about the current status of a workspace.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceStatus
---@field state aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceState The current state of the workspace.
---@field error? aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceErrorDetails Contains associated error information, if any.

---@alias aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceSummaries aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceSummary[]

---Contains summary information about a workspace, including its name, ARN, status, and creation and update timestamps.
---@class aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceSummary
---@field name aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceName The name of the workspace.
---@field arn aws.iotsitewise.ARN The ARN of the workspace.
---@field status aws.iotsitewise.WorkspaceStatus The status of the workspace.
---@field createdAt aws.iotsitewise.Timestamp The date the workspace was created, in Unix epoch time.
---@field updatedAt aws.iotsitewise.Timestamp The date the workspace was last updated, in Unix epoch time.

